window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Cutter and his hot mix of humans and Enders are back in the thrilling conclusion to Endworld! </b></p> <p>The endgame is fast approaching, and Cutter finds his efforts to kill Atticus and the Rising foiled at every turn. But soon he will realize the power dynamic in the Ends is even more complicated than he could ever imagine. </p> <p>Giant monsters and new dangers lurk in the Ends. Listen at your own risk. </p> <p><i>Warning:</i> Contains a harem.</p>"; 
